# v1.0.0

## Features
[feature] Bluetooth HID keyboard and mouse that a computer can pair without extra software
[feature] Desktop helper for Windows, Ubuntu, and macOS (Intel from 11.7, Apple Silicon) when HID is unavailable
[feature] Compact trackpad with left/right click and two-finger scroll
[feature] Portrait and landscape layouts, QWERTY or AZERTY, AmL Keyboard look options and extra palettes including dark themes
[feature] AmL Remote mark and still hummingbird on the space bar

